  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Sleek, low-top casual silhouette for everyday styleAiry mesh upper with synthetic overlaysIconic Nike Swoosh and metallic accents for sportswear styleLace closure secures a snug, personalized fitVisible Max Air cushioning for soft landings and legendary lineageCushlon foam midsole provides ample cushioningRubber outsole adds durability and gripThe Nike Air Max Moto 2K is imported.Familiar yet fresh, the Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max Moto 2K Casual Shoes bring legendary flavor to your tot's everyday style. Designed by the sneaker legend Tinker Hatfield, this mini version of the Air Max Moto 2K brings back the performance tech look from the 2000s, pairing a lightweight, breathable upper with sculpted lines and plush cushioning for an everyday stunner guaranteed to turn heads.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids' Toddler Nike Air Max Moto 2K Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Kids'</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Toddler</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Wolf Grey/Vast Grey/Cool Grey/Wolf Grey</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3833131</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"marg